  Text: |-
    Spatial Image turns flat photos into 3D images you can look around.
    
    Use the panel to switch between four examples: the Spatial Image API, a Gaussian splat, a Gaussian splat sequence and on-device depth estimation.
    
    The Spatial Image API example needs an internet connection and a Remote Service Gateway token.
